INPUT INSTRUCTIONS

  TITLE:	Latent class analysis (LCA) with covariates

      Data- Simulated PrEP dataset
      (designed to resemble the characteristics of the original data)

      Note -    The simulated dataset approximates the structure
      and characteristics of the original data but does not
      reproduce the original observations. Consequently,
      parameter estimates and fit statistics will differ
      from those reported in the manuscript.


  DATA:	
     file is dataPREP-sim-v1.dat;

  VARIABLE:	
     names are pep lubrif testhiv	penet condom
     age race educ hivrisk classe;
     usevariables are pep lubrif testhiv	penet condom
     age race educ hivrisk;
     classes = c (2);
     categorical = pep lubrif testhiv	penet condom;

  ANALYSIS:	
     type = mixture;
     STARTS = 1000 100;
     STITERATIONS = 20;

  MODEL:
         %OVERALL%
          c on age race educ hivrisk;

  OUTPUT:  CINTERVAL;




